rule purchase_form v1
description "What ringi writes from the form of purchase.ringi: the totals and computations, and when a field is shown and asked for"

elements lines
  quantity : number  range >=1 <=10_000
  price    : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=50_000_000JPY

define subtotal : money[JPY] = quantity * price  range >=1JPY <=100_000_000JPY

sum amount over lines of subtotal  range >=1JPY <=100_000_000JPY

outputs
  amount : money[JPY]  round down(1JPY)
